DaysSincePrevEncounter = time since any prior system contact
DaysSincePrevDiabetesEncounter = time since prior diabetes contact
PriorEncounters180/365 = total prior usage
PriorOutpatient180 = prior routine care
PriorED180/365 = prior emergency care
PriorInpatient180/365 = prior hospitalizations
